{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Blood Scent applies its Accursed Form execute damage and direct leech (#506)",
  "contract": [
    "The supplied active Blood Scent (804223) description and effect values specify 15% increased damage",
    "in Accursed Form (562572) against enemies below 35% maximum health and a 10% direct-damage leech.",
    "Exactly 35% is excluded. Native melee, spell and periodic damage hooks must return 1150 from a base",
    "of 1000 only with the talent, the form and an eligible target. The leech paragraph has no form",
    "requirement. A normal Mortal Form Valanar's Vengeance cast below the threshold must invoke the",
    "existing Blood Scent leech helper 807300 and heal its caster; an above-threshold cast must not. The",
    "target health pool is asserted, and ordinary fixture-player regeneration is disabled. This scenario",
    "observes server calculations and combat logs, not rendered client behavior."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
